# Git attributes for CyberX Event Management System

# Render Blueprints
# render.yaml         -> production Blueprint (cyberx-event-mgmt-prod, branch main)
# render.staging.yaml -> staging Blueprint (cyberx-event-mgmt-staging, branch staging)
# Both files are identical on every branch, so staging<->main merges never
# carry one environment's config into the other. Edit the file for the
# environment you mean to change; no merge=ours rule is needed.

# Optional: Protect other environment-specific files if they diverge between branches
# Uncomment these if you have branch-specific versions of these files:
# .env merge=ours
# docker-compose.yml merge=ours
# backend/alembic.ini merge=ours
